<title>UK: Fenner yr pretax dips but payout raised.</title>
<headline>Fenner yr pretax dips but payout raised.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to August 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		12.93		  vs 10.21</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.3		    vs 3.0</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 5.0		    vs 4.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     12.5		   vs 13.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   259		    vs 225</p>
<p>NOTE - Industrial engineering group Fenner Plc, said its pretax profit included restructuring costs and a loss on the sale and termination of operations of 7.0 million stg. It added current trading was encouraging and in line with expectations.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 14.04		  vs 14.49</p>
<p> Interest charge	  1.26		   vs 1.82</p>
<p> Tax			  6.66		   vs 5.0</p>
<p> Net taxed		  5.81		   vs 8.14</p>
<p> Retained		   0.54		   vs 3.75</p>
<p> Pay date		   January 13, 1997</p>
<p> Div registration date  December 3</p>
<p> Ex-div date		November 25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
